      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Nagiyev and Viktor have a heated argument in the office about the restaurant's budget. Nagiyev wants to save money by firing the most expensive kitchen staff. Let's listen closely to the conversation in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Я должен уволить твоих поваров.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты совсем сошёл с ума?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Они слишком дорого стоят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Это почти полмиллиона каждый месяц.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты не можешь их увольнять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это лучшая команда в Москве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Дешевле найти новых людей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Какая разница, кто режет морковь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это моя команда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Если ты их уволишь, ты потеряешь меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Витя, просто сядь и успокойся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хорошо, разбирайтесь сами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А я пока увольняюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Подожди, мы всё решим.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Firings line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Я должен уволить твоих поваров.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I must fire your cooks.' Nagiyev bluntly states that the kitchen staff needs to be let go.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты совсем сошёл с ума?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you gone completely crazy?' Chef Barinov is outraged, asking if the owner has lost his mind entirely.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Они слишком дорого стоят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They cost too much.' Nagiyev complains about the massive expense of keeping everyone around.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Это почти полмиллиона каждый месяц.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is almost half a million every month.' He throws out a huge number to emphasize just how much cash they are bleeding.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты не можешь их увольнять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot fire them.' Chef Barinov stands his ground, strictly forbidding the owner from doing this.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это лучшая команда в Москве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the best team in Moscow.' He proudly defends his crew as the greatest group of culinary experts around.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Дешевле найти новых людей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is cheaper to find new people.' Nagiyev brushes off the sentiment, arguing that fresh hires would cost less.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Какая разница, кто режет морковь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What difference does it make who cuts carrots?' He dismisses the skill required for basic prep work, making it sound trivial.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это моя команда!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is my team!' Chef Barinov yells fiercely, showing his fierce loyalty to his people.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Если ты их уволишь, ты потеряешь меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you fire them, you will lose me.' He delivers an ultimatum, threatening to walk away if the crew gets the boot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Витя, просто сядь и успокойся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vitya, just sit and calm down.' Nagiyev tries to defuse the tension, telling him to take a seat and relax.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Хорошо, разбирайтесь сами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, sort it out yourselves.' Chef Barinov angrily tells him to figure it all out without his help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А я пока увольняюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am quitting in the meantime.' He dramatically announces his resignation right on the spot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Подожди, мы всё решим.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, we will solve everything.' Nagiyev desperately tells him to hold on, promising they can work things out. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
